        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="facts" value="Every pod runs Valkey 9.1, Sentinel, an HAProxy master proxy, the exporter and an Istio sidecar. Sentinel promotes a replica after 5 s without an answer from the primary; HAProxy in every pod follows the new primary, so applications keep one address and need no Sentinel support. Required anti-affinity puts the three pods on three nodes; Argo CD keeps its own Redis." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
